# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> (pain)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> "A bodily process in an organism S involving two integrated levels: (a) activation of the nociceptive system and associated emotion generating brain components of S, and (b) a simultaneous aversive sensory and emotional experience on the part of S, where (b) is phenomenologically similar to the sort of aversive experience involved in pain with concordant tissue damage."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> "http://www.referent-tracking.com/RTU/sendfile/?file=painTokyo1_27_2011.pdf")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ogms.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> "pain")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000085> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000020>)

